{"parentUuid":"eef7b098-f940-449e-8e4b-de987d0222b5","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/workspace/pydantic","sessionId":"44dfef26-6b59-42ce-8f47-f2fd211e30e9","version":"2.0.28","gitBranch":"","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01597TaMZQTX2PJpfsSkKf8u","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"Ticket: TICK-0001\\nTitle: Bug Report: TypedDict Schema JSON Generation Missing Extra Behavior\\nDescription: Issue with Pydantic's JSON schema generation where `typed_dict_schema` ignores `extra` configuration when there is no `cls` parameter. The `JsonSchemaGenerator.typed_dict_schema` method only checks `config.get('extra')` but doesn't look at `schema.get('extra_behavior')` or `config.extra_fields_behavior`. This affects our pydantic-ai integration where we create schemas without cls. Workaround implemented locally but upstream fix needed.\\nTeam: engineering\\nStatus: done\\nPriority: medium\\nLead: douwe_m\\nLabels: None\\nMilestone: None\\nStart Date: Not set\\nDue Date: Not set\\nCreated: 2025-08-04 15:30:00 by douwe_m\\nUpdated: 2025-08-05 18:30:00\"}"}]},"uuid":"4877b868-7b1e-46e7-abe0-f9a2f4b30185","timestamp":"2025-10-29T17:33:31.134Z","toolUseResult":"{\"result\":\"Ticket: TICK-0001\\nTitle: Bug Report: TypedDict Schema JSON Generation Missing Extra Behavior\\nDescription: Issue with Pydantic's JSON schema generation where `typed_dict_schema` ignores `extra` configuration when there is no `cls` parameter. The `JsonSchemaGenerator.typed_dict_schema` method only checks `config.get('extra')` but doesn't look at `schema.get('extra_behavior')` or `config.extra_fields_behavior`. This affects our pydantic-ai integration where we create schemas without cls. Workaround implemented locally but upstream fix needed.\\nTeam: engineering\\nStatus: done\\nPriority: medium\\nLead: douwe_m\\nLabels: None\\nMilestone: None\\nStart Date: Not set\\nDue Date: Not set\\nCreated: 2025-08-04 15:30:00 by douwe_m\\nUpdated: 2025-08-0